<title>USA: ALPINE SKIING-LEADING RESULTS IN MEN'S WORLD CUP GIANT FIRST RUN.</title>
<headline>ALPINE SKIING-LEADING RESULTS IN MEN'S WORLD CUP GIANT FIRST RUN.</headline>
<dateline>BRECKENRIDGE, Colorado 1996-11-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Leading results</p>
<p>in the first run of the men's World Cup giant slalom at</p>
<p>Breckenridge, Colorado, on Saturday:</p>
<p>1. Urs Kaelin (Switzerland) 1:05.11</p>
<p>2. Kjetil Andre Aamodt (Norway) 1:05.36</p>
<p>3. Hans Knaus (Austria) 1:05.51</p>
<p>4. Steve Locher (Switzerland) l:05.55</p>
<p>5. Fredrik Nyberg (Sweden) 1:05.56</p>
<p>6. Jure Kosir (Slovenia) 1:05.87</p>
<p>7. Patrick Holzer (Italy) 1:05.92</p>
<p>8. Tom Stiansen (Norway) 1:05.97</p>
<p>9. Christian Mayer (Austria) 1:05.98</p>
<p>10. Michael Von Gruenigen (Switzerland) 1:06.17</p>
</text>
